    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Last Stand: once per Long Rest, when you would drop to 0 Hit Points, you drop to 1 instead and regain half your Hit Point maximum (automatic). Recover Vitality: a pool of ten d10s (the feat's uses); as a Bonus Action spend any number, roll them and regain that many Hit Points. The pool refills on a Long Rest.</p>",
